{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a game that simulates the survival, development and exploration of civilization in the game. The game is divided into three parts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Sky of Chaos. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization exists, develops, and evolves in a world of three or more bodies, with the ultimate goal of escaping from chaotic star systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Suspicion of Abyss.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization is in a star cluster, facing a major test of the Dark Forest Law. The difficult decision is whether to hide or attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Galaxy of Slaughter.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous civilizations are fighting, expanding, and upgrading within a galaxy, and only one civilization can achieve ultimate victory.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Looking up at the starry sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/1d224867e64f7a6d5a2a0f8dbc0a90b0f6d4037a.jpg"},{"name":"Astrology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/2f50271506c114964b33cd9540795bf498fa5b66.jpg"},{"name":"Great Prophet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/54781033bcde11130f2a96ec8864713ce27a36ed.jpg"},{"name":"Embracing the suns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/286928958fb9725226900c1cfbb8d1be1ea75050.jpg"},{"name":"Debut of galaxy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/d75579feb82a4c93bb0c61cf1f80453f715d22de.jpg"},{"name":"Expert of galaxy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1725860/4edbd9ec667794e60870fc8e3acea66acef4ca45.jpg"},{"nam